.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114121#issuecomment-3669684178","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114121","id":3669684178,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7auu_S","user":{"login":"ogutsemih00-boop","id":245676963,"node_id":"U_kgDODqS7ow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245676963?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop","html_url":"https://github.com/ogutsemih00-boop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-18T10:54:41Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T10:54:41Z","body":"Tested on Windows 10 using Godot 4.6.beta1.\nEven with the same re-reproduce steps, the freezing issue persists during (re)import.\nI will test future beta versions when they are released.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3669684178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3677644503","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114121#issuecomment-3677644503","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114121","id":3677644503,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bNGbX","user":{"login":"ogutsemih00-boop","id":245676963,"node_id":"U_kgDODqS7ow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245676963?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop","html_url":"https://github.com/ogutsemih00-boop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-20T09:22:23Z","updated_at":"2025-12-20T09:22:23Z","body":"After deleting the entire .godot directory, the project becomes impossible to open because the editor immediately re-enters a blocking import state with high CPU usage (~60–70%). The project cannot be accessed at all unless all assets are removed.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3677644503/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678771779","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114121#issuecomment-3678771779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114121","id":3678771779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bRZpD","user":{"login":"ogutsemih00-boop","id":245676963,"node_id":"U_kgDODqS7ow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245676963?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop","html_url":"https://github.com/ogutsemih00-boop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-21T12:55:35Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T12:57:19Z","body":"Retested on Windows 10 using Godot 4.6 (BETA 2) and Godot 4.4 stable.\nDespite the same reproduction steps, the freezing issue during (re)import persists.\nI will test when future beta versions are released.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678771779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678858563","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114121#issuecomment-3678858563","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114121","id":3678858563,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bRu1D","user":{"login":"ogutsemih00-boop","id":245676963,"node_id":"U_kgDODqS7ow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245676963?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop","html_url":"https://github.com/ogutsemih00-boop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-21T14:45:28Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T14:45:28Z","body":"Technical Update from --verbose logs: I've analyzed the verbose logs and here are the findings:\n\nThe freeze occurs after the physical import of assets is finished. For example, the logs show V8.png was imported in 24ms, but the editor became unresponsive right after.\n\nProject Scale: The .godot/imported folder has 3600 entries.\n\nThe Trigger: Deleting the .godot folder forces a full re-import, which reliably triggers an infinite freeze with ~60% CPU usage. Adding new GLB/FBX assets to a project with many existing imported assets also triggers it.\n\nHardware: Intel i5-10200H (8 threads). Log shows WorkerThreadPool: 8 threads being initialized.\n\nObservation: This is not a crash, but a deadlock/infinite loop in the EditorFileSystem scan or dependency re-calculation phase. Even after 15 minutes, the CPU usage stays constant and the editor never recovers.\n\n[FAULTY PARTS.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24279161/FAULTY.PARTS.txt)\n[DEBUG.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24279160/DEBUG.txt)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678858563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678865324","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114121#issuecomment-3678865324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114121","id":3678865324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bRwes","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-21T14:53:11Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T14:53:11Z","body":"Can you try disabling multi threaded import in the Project Settings, to see if that's the issue? (Editor > Import > Use Multiple Threads)\n\n<img width=\"1197\" height=\"701\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/beb06875-e462-4654-80a8-49d07cf29b69\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678865324/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678879616","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114121#issuecomment-3678879616","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114121","id":3678879616,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bRz-A","user":{"login":"ogutsemih00-boop","id":245676963,"node_id":"U_kgDODqS7ow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245676963?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop","html_url":"https://github.com/ogutsemih00-boop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-21T15:12:27Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T15:12:27Z","body":"> Sorunun bu olup olmadığını görmek için Proje Ayarlarında çoklu iş parçacıklı içe aktarmayı devre dışı bırakmayı deneyebilir misiniz? (Düzenleyici > İçe Aktar > Çoklu İş Parçacığı Kullan)\n> \n> <img alt=\"Görüntü\" width=\"1197\" height=\"701\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6501975/528978200-beb06875-e462-4654-80a8-49d07cf29b69.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..1Plx-XGC4CPMQ1Hm-vCrCIQhAWyrCorVjHN_WoxJPG0\">\n\nYes, I was trying exactly that. It took a little longer after deleting the .godot/imported folder, but everything imported without any problems. Now I'll try importing a complex glb file for my second test. I'll share the results with you immediately.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678879616/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678886894","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114121#issuecomment-3678886894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114121","id":3678886894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bR1vu","user":{"login":"ogutsemih00-boop","id":245676963,"node_id":"U_kgDODqS7ow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245676963?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop","html_url":"https://github.com/ogutsemih00-boop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogutsemih00-boop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-21T15:22:04Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T15:22:56Z","body":"> Can you try disabling multi threaded import in the Project Settings, to see if that's the issue? (Editor > Import > Use Multiple Threads)\n> \n> <img alt=\"Image\" width=\"1197\" height=\"701\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6501975/528978200-beb06875-e462-4654-80a8-49d07cf29b69.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..Kx_0rwT6s1shMddx9eqyHtSrWjSeS-Z9SIEEShnFk1U\">\n\nFINAL AND COMPLETE RESULT: The problem was as you described; I tried disabling multithreaded import in the project settings, and that was the issue. Yes, the solution worked. This didn't increase the import time, and the imports worked smoothly. However, I'll leave this open in case others encounter similar problems. Thank you for your support.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678886894/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4803260680","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114121#issuecomment-4803260680","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114121","id":4803260680,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHkvxCA","user":{"login":"x0r-b0t","id":190351008,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1iGoA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190351008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0r-b0t","html_url":"https://github.com/x0r-b0t","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0r-b0t/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0r-b0t/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0r-b0t/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0r-b0t/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0r-b0t/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0r-b0t/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0r-b0t/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0r-b0t/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0r-b0t/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-25T19:04:09Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T19:04:09Z","body":"I'm running into the same issue in one of my projects as well. Symptoms are exactly as described, with the exception that my \"freeze\" happens during a png texture import (originally from an imported glb file). The workaround is also the same: disabling Import > Use Multiple Threads.\n\nSystem info:\nGodot v4.7.stable - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 (nvidia; 595.71.05) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-7100 CPU @ 3.90GHz (4 threads) - 31.30 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\nI compiled Godot with some extra logging and traced it to the `command_queue.push_and_sync` call in `BetsyCompressor::init()` that never returns:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5b4e0cb0fd279832bbdd69fed5354d4e5ad26f88/modules/betsy/image_compress_betsy.cpp#L276-L282\n\nThis also means the mutex acquired in `ensure_betsy_exists()` is never released, and subsequent texture compressions all call `ensure_betsy_exists()` and end up waiting on this mutex indefinitely:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5b4e0cb0fd279832bbdd69fed5354d4e5ad26f88/modules/betsy/image_compress_betsy.cpp#L858-L865 \n\nI noticed in a working project, the `BetsyCompressor::_thread_loop()` function executes which causes `command_queue.push_and_sync()` to return each time, while in a non-working project `BetsyCompressor::_thread_loop()` never executes.\n\nI'm not familiar enough with C++ and the codebase to dig any deeper. But maybe it gives someone who is, a clue.\n\nUnfortunately I also weren't able to create an MRP.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4803260680/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]